# lx-hostpolicy (WS-A, LOUPE-PERFORMANCE-PLAN.md). Sizes from the memory table in /mnt/owl-data/fin-wt/headless/LX-HOSTPOLICY-STATUS.md.
# Automated work that is not inside fin-watchdog.service: job test containers, release builds (systemd-run --slice).
[Unit]
Description=Headless jobs fleet: builds, test databases (runs only on CPU the live service leaves)
[Slice]
CPUWeight=idle
IOWeight=25
MemoryHigh=6G
MemorySwapMax=4G
